ACKNOWLEDGMENTS

This project was inspired by the original `vtf2png` command-line tool in C
written by eXeC64 (https://github.com/eXeC64/vtf2png), which is licensed
under GPLv2. This project is an independent clean-room reimplementation in
Rust written from the public VTF format specification on the Valve Developer
Community wiki — no GPL source code from the upstream project is included,
copied, or derived. We thank @eXeC64 for publishing the original tool, which
brought attention to the format and made this implementation possible.

DXT block decoding is provided by the `texture2ddecoder` crate
(https://crates.io/crates/texture2ddecoder), MIT/Apache-2.0 dual-licensed.
PNG encoding is provided by the `png` crate (https://crates.io/crates/png),
MIT/Apache-2.0 dual-licensed. Their license terms apply to those components
and are reproduced in their respective crate sources.
